# Query 2: Multi-document comparison - EBIT margins
# Highlights: retrieval from multiple documents + analytical comparison

Output recordings/02_compare_margins.mp4

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "cd /home/axel-oeberg/pvk/quantera && source venv/bin/activate && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type `make query Q="Compare the EBIT margin of Volvo Group and Atlas Copco in Q1 2025"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 18s
